 r←PrefixReadmeIds_ match;m;ind;v
⍝ Replacement function for `PrefixReadmeIds`; see there for what this is for.
⍝ `prefix` is not an argument because ⎕R decides what a replacement function is given: it
⍝ comes from the caller, where it is a local.
 m←match.Match
 ind←m⍳'"'
 v←¯1↓ind↓m
 r←m
 :If 'id'≡⎕C(ind-2)↑m
     r←(ind↑m),prefix,v,'"'
 :ElseIf 0<≢v
 :AndIf '#'=⊃v
     r←(ind↑m),'#',prefix,(1↓v),'"'
 :EndIf
